Responsible (R): Lease Portfolio Mgr / Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3180_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3180_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
