        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Treasury/Finance (links to VS-18) report profitability to ALCO/Finance Committee; calibrate new-business pricing to hit target return-on-risk-adjusted-capital; feed into strategy (W3161)
Responsible (R): Finance / Treasury
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3180_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3180_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
