        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: At portfolio scale: evaluate securitization / lease-asset-backed securities (ABS) or whole-portfolio sale to free capital and reduce funding cost; engage investment bank for structuring
Responsible (R): Treasury / Investment Bank
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Event-driven</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3181_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3181_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
