    <bpmn:process id="W_W3184" name="W3184. Lease Customer Lifetime Value &amp; Portfolio Strategy" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual strategy; CLV model refresh
Frequency: Annual + event-driven
Volume: Whole portfolio
Owner: Lease Portfolio Manager
Participants: Lease Portfolio Mgr, Finance, BI (links to VS-28), B2B Sales (links to VS-11), Strategy (links to VS-33)
Source: workflow W3184 — Lease Customer Lifetime Value &amp; Portfolio Strategy</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3184_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3184_Lane1" name="BI Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3184_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3184_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3184_Lane2" name="B2B Sales">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3184_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3184_Lane3" name="Lease Portfolio Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3184_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3184_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3184_Start5" name="Annual strategy; CLV model refresh">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3184_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3184_Task6" name="BI/Finance (links to VS-28) compute customer lifetime value: expected revenue…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: BI/Finance (links to VS-28) compute customer lifetime value: expected revenue (lease income + cross-sell of merchandise, services, retail-media — links to VS-48), cost (funding, credit, ops), retention/renewal rate, NPV; segment by customer type
Responsible (R): BI Analyst / Finance
Accountable (A): Lease Portfolio Manager
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3184_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3184_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3184_Task7" name="B2B Sales/Lease Portfolio Mgr identify high-CLV segments and design…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: B2B Sales/Lease Portfolio Mgr identify high-CLV segments and design portfolio-growth plays: cross-sell lease to merchandise customers (links to VS-11), bundle maintenance/service (links to VS-12), offer trade-in/upgrade cycle (links to VS-09); align sales incentives
Responsible (R): B2B Sales / Lease Portfolio Mgr
Accountable (A): Head of Trade / Account Management
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3184_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3184_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3184_Task8" name="Strategy/Lease Portfolio Mgr refine portfolio strategy (W3161) based on CLV…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Strategy/Lease Portfolio Mgr refine portfolio strategy (W3161) based on CLV: target segments, asset categories, partner mix, pricing; report to executive committee (links to VS-33/VS-36)
Responsible (R): Lease Portfolio Mgr / Strategy
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3184_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3184_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3184_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3184_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3184_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-519 (ensure controlled execution — Lease Portfolio Risk, Residual &amp; Yield Analytics (PA-96.3).) | - operational: conservative assumptions and back-testing
Owner: Lease Portfolio Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
